WEBVTT

01:30.950 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:37.970
[Episode 32]

01:38.370 --> 01:39.380
600 thousand dan?

01:40.680 --> 01:41.360
Two or three hundred of...

01:41.360 --> 01:42.420
Did you hear correctly?

01:42.420 --> 01:43.680
It's absolutely true.

01:44.850 --> 01:46.210
It's 3.6 million dan.

01:47.150 --> 01:47.920
That much?

01:48.280 --> 01:49.200
How could a small place like Nantong

01:49.200 --> 01:50.330
possibly absorb it?

01:50.850 --> 01:52.039
He originally planned

01:52.039 --> 01:53.570
to transport it to Nanjing,

01:53.650 --> 01:55.039
but seeing Nantong hit by disaster,

01:55.039 --> 01:56.680
he wants to sell part of it here

01:56.680 --> 01:57.680
before moving on.

02:01.270 --> 02:02.780
Where's Li Million's

02:02.840 --> 02:03.840
good-for-nothing son?

02:03.840 --> 02:05.070
He hasn't returned to Nanjing yet.

02:05.070 --> 02:06.000
But don't worry.

02:06.070 --> 02:07.870
We've posted men at every dock.

02:07.970 --> 02:09.169
As soon as he shows up,

02:09.400 --> 02:10.400
he won't get away.

02:17.190 --> 02:17.800
Look.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.120
This is the place.

02:29.760 --> 02:30.430
Sir,

02:30.960 --> 02:32.140
greetings.

02:32.390 --> 02:34.600
Who are you?

02:35.430 --> 02:36.520
My surname is Yang,

02:36.960 --> 02:38.560
and I'm also a rice merchant.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.150
I heard you're here,

02:42.760 --> 02:44.290
so I came to pay my respects.

02:45.510 --> 02:46.880
May I ask your name?

02:47.400 --> 02:48.460
My surname is Liao.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.640
Please sit down and let's talk.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.400
What brings you here?

02:54.030 --> 02:55.680
You're such a big businessman.

02:55.680 --> 02:57.680
Why don't you have a butler with you?

02:59.079 --> 03:01.590
I'm not like those young fellows

03:01.800 --> 03:03.360
who make little money

03:03.710 --> 03:05.080
but put on a big show.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.750
I'm afraid they'll

03:07.800 --> 03:09.270
steal my money,

03:09.360 --> 03:11.090
so I don't bring anyone with me.

03:11.470 --> 03:13.050
I keep my own books.

03:13.310 --> 03:14.030
Come on, sir,

03:14.030 --> 03:14.710
you...

03:32.190 --> 03:32.870
Sir,

03:33.240 --> 03:34.560
I heard you brought

03:34.590 --> 03:36.250
600,000 dan of rice this time.

03:37.590 --> 03:39.310
I'm also in the grain business.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.329
I'm a bit confused.

03:40.329 --> 03:41.329
May I ask—

03:42.200 --> 03:43.370
can you really sell

03:43.390 --> 03:44.740
that much?

03:46.000 --> 03:48.800
I heard Nantong's coastal embankment
collapsed.

03:49.150 --> 03:51.680
The farmland was flooded with seawater,

03:51.980 --> 03:53.500
so it may take 2 or 3 years

03:53.530 --> 03:55.260
before it can grow crops again.

03:55.470 --> 03:56.270
What's wrong?

03:56.800 --> 03:57.600
Can't sell it?

03:57.829 --> 03:59.360
Hard to say.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.970
It depends on your price.

04:02.670 --> 04:03.540
You're fishing for my bottom line.

04:03.540 --> 04:04.310
No.

04:05.240 --> 04:07.420
If I know your pricing,

04:07.450 --> 04:08.520
I can work with it.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.710
We're on the same boat.

04:10.910 --> 04:11.630
Let's not

04:11.650 --> 04:13.120
work against each other.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.080
Forget it.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.399
I've been asking around.

04:17.459 --> 04:19.310
The official price of rice in Nanjing

04:19.310 --> 04:22.670
is 1.2 taels per dan,

04:23.440 --> 04:24.700
but common folks pay

04:24.840 --> 04:26.270
1.8

04:26.310 --> 04:27.250
or 1.9 taels.

04:27.860 --> 04:29.620
In Zhenjiang, the official price

04:29.620 --> 04:31.610
is 1.5 taels.

04:31.640 --> 04:32.990
But the common folks

04:33.190 --> 04:35.409
probably pay over 2 taels.

04:36.280 --> 04:39.530
Nantong is even crazier—

04:39.700 --> 04:42.620
I heard it sells for 3 taels.

04:42.750 --> 04:44.700
If I don't sell my rice here,

04:44.720 --> 04:46.220
wouldn't I be a fool?

04:46.250 --> 04:47.510
But haven't you heard?

04:47.800 --> 04:50.000
Rice won't sell at 3 taels anymore.

04:50.240 --> 04:52.080
I'm actually thinking about

04:52.100 --> 04:53.230
lowering the price.

04:53.460 --> 04:55.320
This is where you fall short of me.

04:55.680 --> 04:58.120
Anhui had a good harvest this year.

04:58.680 --> 05:02.310
I plan to drive my rice price down.

05:02.450 --> 05:04.420
The price will be...

05:04.630 --> 05:05.860
1.2 taels.

05:06.890 --> 05:08.310
Anyway, I still have

05:08.330 --> 05:10.140
3 million dan of rice

05:10.170 --> 05:11.260
waiting to be shipped here.

05:11.260 --> 05:12.880
This breaks the rules.

05:13.630 --> 05:14.920
Your rules

05:14.950 --> 05:16.540
or my rules?

05:18.590 --> 05:20.470
Your rice is from Anhui.

05:20.830 --> 05:22.080
If you drop the price by 0.9 taels,

05:22.080 --> 05:23.410
you won't make a profit.

05:23.530 --> 05:25.320
Along the way, there are expenses for food

05:25.320 --> 05:26.470
for people and horses, road taxes,

05:26.470 --> 05:27.610
and tolls—

05:27.640 --> 05:28.920
all extra costs.

05:29.050 --> 05:31.060
At 1.2 taels per dan,

05:31.180 --> 05:33.340
you won't even cover costs.

05:33.890 --> 05:35.190
I have a large quantity of rice.

05:35.190 --> 05:36.590
That's not the point!

05:37.420 --> 05:39.240
Calm down.

05:39.580 --> 05:41.460
Sit down, sit down.

05:43.570 --> 05:45.010
Think about it.

05:45.790 --> 05:46.940
You sell at 3 taels,

05:47.480 --> 05:49.170
and I sell at 1.2 taels.

05:49.790 --> 05:51.450
Can you still stay in business?

05:51.450 --> 05:52.630
You can't.

05:53.070 --> 05:55.420
Then the business here will belong to me.

05:56.200 --> 05:57.280
Once you leave,

05:57.560 --> 05:58.909
I can sell at 3 taels,

05:59.159 --> 06:00.220
maybe even 4 taels.

06:00.260 --> 06:03.510
The imperial court
is about to start a big project here.

06:04.050 --> 06:07.110
I'll ship all 3 million dan of rice

06:07.140 --> 06:08.170
over here.

06:08.470 --> 06:09.120
I can

06:09.570 --> 06:10.570
make money later.

06:12.160 --> 06:14.340
You are a rich man with a big business.

06:14.530 --> 06:16.380
There's no need to compete

06:16.450 --> 06:18.850
with an old man like me
in this small county.

06:19.190 --> 06:20.310
I'm begging you.

06:25.490 --> 06:27.420
I know a rice merchant from Anhui,

06:27.870 --> 06:28.920
surname Sun.

06:29.290 --> 06:31.220
He's been active in Wuhu for years.

06:31.760 --> 06:32.720
Do you know him?

06:33.659 --> 06:34.320
No, I don't.

06:35.370 --> 06:36.900
He's currently in Nantong.

06:37.490 --> 06:39.500
I consulted with him before coming here.

06:39.500 --> 06:40.450
He told me

06:40.780 --> 06:42.110
he knows all Anhui rice merchants

06:42.110 --> 06:44.000
with business

06:44.120 --> 06:45.580
over a million dan of rice,

06:46.430 --> 06:47.909
but he doesn't know you.

06:50.570 --> 06:52.530
I don't know him either.

06:53.770 --> 06:55.950
I used to be in the tea trade.

06:56.190 --> 06:58.000
That business failed,

06:58.040 --> 07:00.600
so I invested my retirement money in rice.

07:01.270 --> 07:03.800
If you know those

07:03.820 --> 07:05.250
Anhui businessmen,

07:05.370 --> 07:06.360
you can

07:06.390 --> 07:07.720
ask them about

07:07.950 --> 07:09.870
Mr. Liao from Huizhou.

07:10.370 --> 07:11.350
That way,

07:11.660 --> 07:13.120
you'd know my background.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.190
How dare I

07:16.210 --> 07:17.740
look into your background?

07:17.830 --> 07:19.090
We were just chatting.

07:31.670 --> 07:37.700
A single straight purple bamboo.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.070
Come on, everyone.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.270
Mr. Li, you are such an

07:40.270 --> 07:41.140
elegant, talented,

07:41.140 --> 07:42.270
and promising young man.

07:42.270 --> 07:43.159
Yes, yes, yes.

07:46.950 --> 07:47.760
Good wine.

07:49.720 --> 07:50.360
Everyone.

07:50.570 --> 07:51.360
In Nantong,

07:51.620 --> 07:54.740
rice is extremely expensive now.

07:56.220 --> 07:58.190
And if you want beauties

07:58.190 --> 07:59.750
in Jiangnan,

08:00.160 --> 08:02.490
you just need to bring
a little extra rice.

08:04.480 --> 08:05.270
Mr. Li Qin,

08:05.400 --> 08:06.800
are the women in Jiangnan

08:07.190 --> 08:08.330
really as pretty as you say?

08:08.330 --> 08:09.360
Of course.

08:09.380 --> 08:10.310
You haven't been

08:10.340 --> 08:11.550
to Nantong yet.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.520
As the saying goes,

08:13.780 --> 08:16.980
"When Hunan and Hubei harvest,
the whole country is fed."

08:20.280 --> 08:21.450
I'm here this time

08:21.480 --> 08:23.950
to buy rice on His Excellency's orders.

08:25.380 --> 08:26.110
You just need

08:26.720 --> 08:28.620
to ship the rice to Nantong.

08:28.920 --> 08:29.800
I'm using it

08:30.000 --> 08:32.059
for the coastal embankment project.

08:32.789 --> 08:33.720
Before...

08:35.669 --> 08:37.960
I have to make myself clear with you

08:37.980 --> 08:39.370
before I get drunk.

08:39.400 --> 08:40.360
Otherwise, in a while,

08:40.360 --> 08:41.960
I'll definitely forget it.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.440
Mr. Li,

08:44.440 --> 08:45.620
have another drink.

08:45.720 --> 08:46.670
One more! Come on!

08:46.670 --> 08:47.750
Here, here!

08:47.850 --> 08:48.840
Here, Mr. Li.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.480
Here!

08:53.550 --> 08:54.510
-You really can hold your liquor.
-Great.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.240
Impressive!

08:55.750 --> 08:56.720
Hold him up!

08:56.960 --> 08:57.870
I'm fine.

08:57.870 --> 08:58.470
Brothers,

08:58.600 --> 09:00.080
are you having fun today?

09:00.200 --> 09:01.200
Yes!

09:01.240 --> 09:01.640
Great!

09:01.670 --> 09:02.390
You are having fun.

09:02.390 --> 09:02.870
Be careful!

09:02.870 --> 09:03.270
Careful!

09:03.220 --> 09:05.000
♪ I've read the Four Books
and Five Classics ♪

09:03.270 --> 09:04.750
Since you're having fun...

09:04.750 --> 09:06.080
this is your reward!

09:05.020 --> 09:06.690
♪ I've learned to be magnanimous ♪

09:06.720 --> 09:09.270
♪ And forget the past grudges ♪

09:09.320 --> 09:11.320
♪ I've traveled through the years ♪

09:11.350 --> 09:12.950
♪ As life roughens my face ♪

09:12.990 --> 09:15.620
♪ I've felt the coldness between people ♪

09:15.640 --> 09:18.750
♪ I've seen the vast snow ♪

09:17.630 --> 09:18.820
Don't worry about me.

09:18.820 --> 09:21.780
♪ I was once held tightly by someone ♪

09:19.200 --> 09:19.790
Be careful.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.240
Don't worry about me.

09:21.850 --> 09:22.950
♪ The meaning of survival ♪

09:23.030 --> 09:24.920
♪ Is all about staying fed ♪

09:24.970 --> 09:26.420
♪ Turn around ♪

09:26.450 --> 09:28.010
♪ And try to be brave ♪

09:28.070 --> 09:32.900
♪ The show is about to start ♪

09:34.520 --> 09:35.260
Boss,

09:35.550 --> 09:37.150
this is a great opportunity.

09:37.370 --> 09:38.760
Only Li Million's

09:38.790 --> 09:40.480
foolish son can't see it.

09:41.130 --> 09:42.970
Let's make this clear—

09:42.990 --> 09:44.440
we'll make money together,

09:44.440 --> 09:45.800
no hogging the profits.

09:46.200 --> 09:48.660
Tomorrow, each of us will send

09:48.750 --> 09:50.210
a million dan of rice to Nantong.

09:50.210 --> 09:52.080
While he's here having fun,

09:52.510 --> 09:55.440
let's make a tidy profit.

09:55.760 --> 09:56.390
Okay.

09:57.630 --> 09:58.960
-More wine!
-More wine!

09:59.830 --> 10:01.650
♪ No matter how many tears you shed ♪

10:01.720 --> 10:03.230
♪ As long as you can get up ♪

10:03.300 --> 10:05.880
♪ You can brush it off as a joke ♪

10:05.960 --> 10:07.840
♪ If I can still breathe ♪

10:07.930 --> 10:09.430
♪ I can hold up this weight ♪

10:09.520 --> 10:12.190
♪ And brave the blade and storm ♪

10:11.620 --> 10:14.330
[Nanjing]

10:12.270 --> 10:15.290
♪ Life is unpredictable anyway ♪

10:15.320 --> 10:18.350
♪ I clench my teeth and keep going ♪

10:18.400 --> 10:19.500
♪ Let them say ♪

10:18.720 --> 10:20.480
They got here so quickly.

10:19.570 --> 10:21.520
♪ That I can't make it all they want ♪

10:21.590 --> 10:23.020
♪ Turn around ♪

10:23.080 --> 10:24.580
♪ And try to be brave ♪

10:24.660 --> 10:29.280
♪ The show is about to start ♪

10:25.510 --> 10:26.630
Indeed.

10:27.530 --> 10:28.810
Business is like war.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.550
Without some determined tactics,

10:30.020 --> 10:31.390
♪ As a thousand sails drift by ♪

10:30.570 --> 10:31.540
how can you make money?

10:31.410 --> 10:32.660
♪ All the sights of the world ♪

10:31.960 --> 10:32.960
Look at these people—

10:32.780 --> 10:34.550
♪ After everything is settled ♪

10:33.270 --> 10:33.960
which one isn't here

10:33.960 --> 10:35.150
to get a slice of the pie?

10:34.620 --> 10:36.100
♪ A legend starts ♪

10:36.200 --> 10:37.820
♪ This land so vast ♪

10:36.740 --> 10:38.500
If Mr. Liao fails to close the deal

10:37.950 --> 10:42.070
♪ I bear its weight ♪

10:38.550 --> 10:40.140
and these people all head to Nantong,

10:40.140 --> 10:41.270
that'll be trouble.

10:42.740 --> 10:44.040
I've already checked.

10:44.230 --> 10:45.250
There really is a Liao Wu

10:45.250 --> 10:46.920
from Huizhou.

10:47.380 --> 10:49.400
He was born into a noble family

10:49.510 --> 10:51.230
and is skilled
in making and appreciating tea.

10:51.230 --> 10:52.240
However,

10:52.440 --> 10:54.150
he was addicted to drinking and gambling,

10:54.150 --> 10:55.480
ended up deeply in debt,

10:55.480 --> 10:56.630
and lost everything

10:56.670 --> 10:57.400
in business.

10:57.580 --> 10:58.780
He has only one daughter,

10:58.780 --> 11:01.240
and he indeed
used to be a major tea merchant.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.810
Now that he's on my turf,

11:05.200 --> 11:06.550
it looks like he's going to

11:06.550 --> 11:08.150
get a huge advantage over me.

11:09.670 --> 11:11.630
He's even rented a shop.

11:11.740 --> 11:13.840
I'm just afraid
that once he opens tomorrow,

11:13.840 --> 11:15.030
those sirs

11:15.050 --> 11:16.980
will show up demanding a price cut.

11:20.370 --> 11:22.370
This old fox is very cunning.

11:23.590 --> 11:25.360
He wants to squeeze me out

11:26.240 --> 11:27.440
and take

11:27.480 --> 11:30.280
the entire imperial court's project
for himself.

11:30.830 --> 11:31.630
That won't do.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.030
My Lord!

11:35.390 --> 11:35.840
My...

11:37.000 --> 11:37.640
My Lord!

11:37.740 --> 11:38.340
My Lord!

11:39.870 --> 11:40.510
My Lord!

11:40.530 --> 11:41.080
Who is it?

11:43.270 --> 11:43.980
Stop knocking!

11:43.980 --> 11:44.800
My Lord!

11:46.510 --> 11:47.570
Why are you yelling?

11:47.570 --> 11:48.750
Didn't I tell you?

11:48.770 --> 11:49.700
When I'm asleep,

11:49.850 --> 11:51.320
even chickens and dogs
are allowed to make a sound.

11:51.320 --> 11:51.870
My Lord,

11:52.080 --> 11:53.960
Master Gu said just now

11:54.070 --> 11:55.160
that your...

11:55.190 --> 11:57.320
your father is dying.

11:57.430 --> 11:58.600
He told me to wake you.

11:58.600 --> 12:00.850
Otherwise,
I absolutely wouldn't dare do it.

12:00.850 --> 12:01.520
My Lord.

12:01.960 --> 12:03.290
My father is dying?

12:05.400 --> 12:06.600
Get Gu Pingyuan here.

12:07.440 --> 12:07.700
Yes.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.110
Stop.

12:10.270 --> 12:10.750
Get out!

12:22.110 --> 12:22.750
Sir.

12:24.090 --> 12:24.810
Let me ask you—

12:24.810 --> 12:26.120
Whose father is dying?

12:26.150 --> 12:27.150
Even if you were desperate to see me,

12:27.150 --> 12:28.740
you shouldn't have made up a lie
like that.

12:28.740 --> 12:30.110
Do you believe I'll cut you down?

12:30.110 --> 12:31.030
Don't, Sir.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.630
I had a reason.

12:32.650 --> 12:33.640
So you just lied and said

12:33.640 --> 12:34.960
my father was dying?

12:35.720 --> 12:37.060
Good thing my father passed away

12:37.060 --> 12:38.540
years ago,

12:38.710 --> 12:40.520
or you would've scared me to death.

12:40.520 --> 12:42.180
You dare to say anything, huh?

12:43.280 --> 12:44.070
Sir,

12:44.100 --> 12:45.900
why don't you look at this first?

12:51.050 --> 12:51.790
See?

12:52.100 --> 12:53.260
It says

12:53.340 --> 12:55.670
[Ten Thousand Taels of Silver]

12:53.520 --> 12:55.980
"Made in Xianfeng reign
of the Qing Empire."

12:56.050 --> 12:57.540
Isn't this your...

12:57.570 --> 12:58.500
father?

13:02.050 --> 13:02.670
Mine?

13:04.490 --> 13:05.150
Yes, yours.

13:06.580 --> 13:08.330
Let's say it's my father.

13:10.240 --> 13:11.480
You gave me your private money

13:11.480 --> 13:12.440
to do business.

13:12.940 --> 13:14.540
The man I sent to sell the rice

13:14.600 --> 13:15.730
has been gone 4 days,

13:15.770 --> 13:17.570
and the deal still isn't closed.

13:17.670 --> 13:18.840
A lot of grain ships

13:18.910 --> 13:20.940
have arrived at Xiaguan Dock in Nanjing.

13:20.940 --> 13:22.740
Once those ships reach Nantong,

13:23.080 --> 13:25.030
we won't be able to make any profit.

13:25.670 --> 13:27.070
Sir, please give an order

13:27.150 --> 13:28.630
to hold them for one more day.

13:28.630 --> 13:30.610
If this deal fails,

13:30.640 --> 13:32.530
your banknote will be in trouble.

13:32.570 --> 13:34.560
Isn't that your father

13:34.910 --> 13:35.870
on his deathbed?

13:39.040 --> 13:40.630
You're quite something.

13:43.390 --> 13:43.960
Wait.

14:14.410 --> 14:16.240
Send this to Jiu by fast horse.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.510
He'll know what to do.

14:19.080 --> 14:19.940
Let me be clear—

14:20.270 --> 14:21.320
only one day.

14:22.000 --> 14:23.390
If those ships block the river

14:23.390 --> 14:24.410
and I don't let them pass,

14:24.410 --> 14:26.070
there will surely be trouble.

14:26.720 --> 14:27.580
Thank you, Sir.

14:28.640 --> 14:30.510
I hate being woken up.

14:33.510 --> 14:34.260
Everyone!

14:34.360 --> 14:35.270
Stay where you are!

14:35.270 --> 14:36.870
We're searching for rebels!

14:37.040 --> 14:39.330
[A Pier in Nanjing]

14:37.120 --> 14:37.720
Hurry!

14:37.870 --> 14:38.630
Don't move!

14:38.840 --> 14:40.370
-Don't move!
-Nobody move!

14:42.910 --> 14:43.580
Don't move!

14:57.730 --> 14:59.730
Search all grain ships thoroughly.

15:00.040 --> 15:01.640
Don't let any rebels escape.

15:02.210 --> 15:03.700
Without my permission,

15:03.720 --> 15:05.580
no one is allowed to unload cargo.

15:12.160 --> 15:17.550
[Wende Bridge]

15:21.930 --> 15:22.530
Pingyuan,

15:22.740 --> 15:24.060
you've got so many tricks up your sleeve.

15:24.060 --> 15:27.120
You even managed
to bring Marshal Jiu's soldiers here.

15:33.530 --> 15:38.100
[Wende Bridge]

15:35.240 --> 15:35.670
Pingyuan,

15:35.670 --> 15:37.320
is there still no news from Mr. Liao?

15:37.320 --> 15:38.250
No, nothing yet.

15:39.530 --> 15:40.630
Tell me the truth.

15:40.670 --> 15:42.040
Have we bitten off more than we can chew?

15:42.040 --> 15:43.270
Millions of dan of grain—

15:43.270 --> 15:44.140
what if Yang

15:44.160 --> 15:45.160
can't take it all?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.550
Then we'll lose.

15:46.860 --> 15:47.260
Pingyuan,

15:47.260 --> 15:49.750
stop pretending
you've got everything under control.

15:49.750 --> 15:51.150
Let me do the math for you.

15:51.570 --> 15:52.300
1.2 taels—

15:52.330 --> 15:54.400
[Wende Bridge]

15:52.790 --> 15:53.720
that's how much it costs

15:53.720 --> 15:54.830
to transport all this grain per dan.

15:54.830 --> 15:56.320
If you can't sell it, and...

15:56.320 --> 15:58.840
I can't even calculate
our losses, Pingyuan.

15:58.840 --> 15:59.910
What are you afraid of?

15:59.910 --> 16:00.720
The worst case scenario

16:00.720 --> 16:01.920
is that we lose money.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.390
But you promised me

16:03.390 --> 16:04.550
500,000 taels.

16:04.450 --> 16:06.240
[Wende Bridge]

16:04.550 --> 16:06.480
If you lose, I'll be in trouble too.

16:08.110 --> 16:09.200
What if Miss Liao thinks

16:09.200 --> 16:10.530
I'm as unreliable as you

16:10.870 --> 16:12.520
and refuses to marry me?

16:12.600 --> 16:13.660
That would be good.

16:13.880 --> 16:15.100
If she'd only marry you

16:15.100 --> 16:16.050
for your money,

16:16.190 --> 16:17.450
then you're better off

16:17.630 --> 16:19.160
not getting married at all.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.470
No, Pingyuan.

16:20.490 --> 16:21.670
Whether I have money or not,

16:21.670 --> 16:23.130
she's willing to marry me.

16:23.230 --> 16:24.960
I'm just saying if I have money,

16:25.030 --> 16:26.140
I can open a shop and support our family—

16:26.140 --> 16:27.400
wouldn't that be good?

16:27.870 --> 16:28.930
Then let me ask you,

16:29.140 --> 16:30.820
why do you think people do business?

16:30.820 --> 16:32.020
For money, of course.

16:32.630 --> 16:34.060
Have you ever thought about this?

16:34.060 --> 16:35.270
Why does Yang Qianwan

16:35.910 --> 16:37.870
keeps buying more rice

16:37.890 --> 16:39.460
without lowering his price

16:39.660 --> 16:40.420
even a penny?

16:41.240 --> 16:42.720
Because he wants to monopolize Nantong.

16:42.720 --> 16:43.150
Right?

16:44.270 --> 16:45.260
He wants to take over

16:45.260 --> 16:46.750
the rice and flour supply business

16:46.750 --> 16:48.430
for the
coastal embankment construction project.

16:48.430 --> 16:49.520
He's too greedy.

16:50.670 --> 16:51.730
True, no merchant

16:51.760 --> 16:53.510
is completely without greed,

16:53.790 --> 16:55.170
but remember,

16:55.960 --> 16:57.560
one must never be too greedy.

16:57.720 --> 17:02.960
[1.2 Taels of Silver Per Dan]

17:13.000 --> 17:13.980
It's choking in here—

17:13.980 --> 17:15.640
feels like the room's on fire.

17:16.290 --> 17:19.319
I've been waiting for Mr. Yang all night.

17:19.339 --> 17:20.849
I'm the one burning up inside.

17:20.849 --> 17:21.550
The room

17:21.960 --> 17:22.440
isn't.

17:23.109 --> 17:24.020
It's already daylight.

17:24.020 --> 17:25.220
Are we opening or not?

17:27.150 --> 17:30.030
If we keep selling rice at this price,

17:28.890 --> 17:30.510
[1.2 Taels of Silver Per Dan]

17:30.820 --> 17:32.480
we'll lose everything.

17:33.070 --> 17:34.490
Weren't we making a profit before?

17:34.490 --> 17:35.900
Can't it at least break even?

17:35.900 --> 17:37.940
Chang Si made that profit.

17:38.310 --> 17:39.460
If I lose on my turn,

17:39.550 --> 17:40.510
won't

17:40.740 --> 17:41.740
my son-in-law

17:41.910 --> 17:42.770
look down on me?

17:43.170 --> 17:44.500
Stop talking nonsense.

17:44.790 --> 17:47.620
How is that nonsense?

17:48.070 --> 17:50.260
Mr. Chang will definitely laugh at me.

17:50.290 --> 17:51.290
And besides,

17:51.400 --> 17:52.850
if this deal falls through,

17:52.850 --> 17:54.300
what should we do

17:54.350 --> 17:55.550
about your marriage?

17:55.710 --> 17:57.350
You really took that seriously?

17:57.350 --> 17:58.830
How could I not?

17:59.440 --> 18:00.900
I have the most experience

18:00.930 --> 18:02.440
in doing business.

18:02.480 --> 18:02.960
Tell me,

18:03.070 --> 18:04.860
how many businesses have I messed up?

18:04.860 --> 18:05.920
And you're proud of that?

18:05.920 --> 18:07.100
For a businessman,

18:07.270 --> 18:09.610
keeping one's word
is the most important thing.

18:09.610 --> 18:11.650
A deal is a deal,

18:11.720 --> 18:13.240
and a promise is a promise.

18:13.790 --> 18:15.110
Gu Pingyuan has built

18:15.130 --> 18:16.750
a successful business these years

18:16.750 --> 18:19.030
because he keeps his word.

18:19.590 --> 18:20.910
If I can help him

18:20.930 --> 18:22.620
close this deal

18:23.290 --> 18:26.060
and get my 500,000 taels,

18:26.080 --> 18:28.170
then regarding your future

18:28.220 --> 18:29.000
with Gu Pingwen,

18:29.000 --> 18:30.460
I'll finally feel at ease.

18:30.550 --> 18:32.900
Parents are only with you
for part of your life—

18:32.900 --> 18:34.210
only your spouse

18:34.400 --> 18:35.720
is with you for life.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.620
Come on. If he doesn't show up,

18:40.620 --> 18:41.950
you won't open the door?

18:43.290 --> 18:45.420
Won't I take care of you in your old age?

18:47.240 --> 18:48.640
Are you opening up or not?

18:48.780 --> 18:49.270
Yes.

18:50.010 --> 18:50.730
I am.

18:51.620 --> 18:53.350
I see.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.690
It seems I was just

18:56.290 --> 18:58.730
born to be unlucky with the God of Wealth.

19:01.440 --> 19:02.030
Who is it?

19:02.270 --> 19:02.830
It's me!

19:03.030 --> 19:04.000
Me?

19:04.020 --> 19:05.960
How am I supposed to know who you are?

19:05.960 --> 19:06.810
I'm the butler

19:06.830 --> 19:08.130
of Mr. Yang, Yang Qianwan.

19:08.130 --> 19:09.360
I've brought you the banknotes.

19:09.360 --> 19:09.860
Mr. Liao,

19:09.860 --> 19:11.060
please open the door!

19:11.790 --> 19:12.400
Honey!

19:15.750 --> 19:16.960
God of Wealth,

19:16.980 --> 19:18.380
I misspoke just now.

19:19.030 --> 19:20.420
You've always loved me the most.

19:20.420 --> 19:21.450
I finally see hope

19:21.490 --> 19:24.050
for my daughter's marriage,

19:24.110 --> 19:25.590
and I might soon

19:25.620 --> 19:27.010
have a grandchild.

19:27.620 --> 19:28.770
Coming. Coming.

19:29.370 --> 19:30.380
Open the door!

19:32.030 --> 19:33.180
Mr. Liao.

19:34.580 --> 19:35.380
Open the door!

19:35.550 --> 19:36.520
Honey!

19:36.620 --> 19:38.990
Now that the God of Wealth is here,

19:39.020 --> 19:41.040
the door won't open.

19:41.060 --> 19:42.900
The God of Wealth
really doesn't care about me.

19:42.900 --> 19:43.750
Mr. Liao!

19:48.510 --> 19:49.530
You finally opened the door.

19:49.530 --> 19:50.360
Please count them.

19:50.360 --> 19:51.830
I'll settle the accounts with you
in a bit.

19:51.830 --> 19:52.550
Thank you.

20:02.860 --> 20:03.510
Honey.

20:04.960 --> 20:05.820
Open it.

20:06.080 --> 20:07.140
Why should I open it?

20:07.140 --> 20:09.140
Haven't you seen banknotes before?

20:09.290 --> 20:10.810
I've seen banknotes.

20:10.830 --> 20:12.560
But banknotes haven't seen me.

20:16.180 --> 20:16.780
[Ying'en Gate]

20:16.800 --> 20:18.300
[Nantong]

20:20.250 --> 20:21.900
[Jiangning Rice Shop]

20:20.680 --> 20:21.240
Master,

20:22.160 --> 20:24.090
are we still opening the city gate?

20:24.400 --> 20:25.500
This scene...

20:24.450 --> 20:27.160
[Ying'en Gate]

20:26.300 --> 20:27.280
looks a bit scary.

20:27.280 --> 20:28.610
Open it.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.010
I'll open it myself.

20:31.080 --> 20:33.510
They're all Gods of Wealth!

20:34.030 --> 20:35.290
Welcome all of them in!

20:35.810 --> 20:37.510
One by one!

20:37.390 --> 20:40.880
[Jiangning Rice Shop]

20:40.920 --> 20:44.010
[Peace and Abundance]

20:44.290 --> 20:46.280
All the carriages, come this way!

20:48.150 --> 20:48.990
Everyone,

20:50.060 --> 20:51.540
many houses in Nantong

20:52.450 --> 20:54.250
have been destroyed.

20:54.270 --> 20:55.630
Today I'll clear out

20:55.660 --> 20:56.580
the government office

20:56.580 --> 20:57.600
for you to use as a warehouse.

20:57.600 --> 21:00.010
All those grain carts outside the city—

21:00.430 --> 21:01.690
I'll make sure

21:00.910 --> 21:07.870
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

21:02.140 --> 21:04.950
they're brought in before dark.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.710
Your Worship.

21:07.010 --> 21:08.100
Your Worship.

21:08.310 --> 21:09.270
Who are you guys?

21:09.580 --> 21:11.440
We met each other

21:11.460 --> 21:12.460
on the way here.

21:13.270 --> 21:14.040
May I ask

21:14.170 --> 21:15.830
what the current rice price is

21:15.840 --> 21:16.510
in Nantong?

21:20.280 --> 21:21.850
Three taels per dan.

21:22.840 --> 21:23.990
Three taels per dan.

21:24.020 --> 21:24.630
Guys.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.890
Look at the current state...

21:25.740 --> 21:29.010
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

21:27.910 --> 21:28.930
of Nantong.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.700
Come on. You...

21:30.730 --> 21:32.820
Look at me.

21:33.240 --> 21:35.210
Does it look like it can be sold?

21:35.750 --> 21:36.640
Your Worship,

21:37.220 --> 21:38.290
we're all from

21:38.350 --> 21:39.960
Hunan and Hubei.

21:40.130 --> 21:41.800
What do you mean it can't be sold?

21:41.800 --> 21:42.880
You've all seen

21:41.870 --> 21:44.970
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

21:42.910 --> 21:44.940
the condition of people in Nantong.

21:45.560 --> 21:46.770
As for the rice price—

21:46.800 --> 21:48.280
it has to be reasonable.

21:49.330 --> 21:51.530
How much do you think is reasonable?

21:51.850 --> 21:53.650
At 3 taels per dan,

21:53.680 --> 21:55.610
nobody will buy it.

21:57.520 --> 21:59.040
You might as well take it all back.

21:58.990 --> 22:01.320
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

21:59.640 --> 22:00.790
Come on, let's go!

22:00.810 --> 22:01.170
Wait.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.620
Your Worship! Your Worship!

22:02.620 --> 22:04.570
Let's go clean out

22:04.590 --> 22:05.660
the government office.

22:05.660 --> 22:06.580
We're doomed!

22:06.660 --> 22:07.550
Please don't stop us!

22:07.550 --> 22:08.270
Don't stop us!

22:08.270 --> 22:09.680
We need to think about what to do.

22:09.680 --> 22:10.480
I...

22:10.500 --> 22:12.160
Listen to me!

22:13.360 --> 22:15.670
Hold the price!

22:16.040 --> 22:16.690
Mr. Yang,

22:16.720 --> 22:17.880
please step aside.

22:18.020 --> 22:18.790
Outside there

22:18.790 --> 22:19.770
are hundreds of shops.

22:19.770 --> 22:20.620
If I don't sell,

22:20.620 --> 22:21.850
am I supposed to let the rice rot here?

22:21.850 --> 22:23.230
Why don't you be a good man all the way

22:23.230 --> 22:24.620
and buy all our rice?

22:24.980 --> 22:26.000
You're keeping the price up anyway,

22:26.000 --> 22:27.210
and we don't want that pearl.

22:27.210 --> 22:27.840
Right.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.200
You bought from others

22:29.200 --> 22:30.030
at 3 taels per dan.

22:30.030 --> 22:31.230
Since we're friends,

22:31.260 --> 22:32.830
I'll sell it to you at 1.2 taels.

22:32.830 --> 22:34.360
You've gone mad with greed.

22:34.470 --> 22:35.630
You came here to take advantage of me?

22:35.630 --> 22:36.430
Well...

22:41.430 --> 22:41.990
Master.

22:44.130 --> 22:45.360
How is it?

22:45.380 --> 22:46.580
Calm down, Master.

22:46.600 --> 22:48.520
Me calming down won't solve anything.

22:48.520 --> 22:49.520
What's the price?

22:49.780 --> 22:51.070
In Nantong now,

22:51.970 --> 22:53.700
it's one tael of silver per dan.

22:53.830 --> 22:54.710
What?

22:54.820 --> 22:55.790
All that work for nothing?

22:55.790 --> 22:57.120
Why did it drop so fast?

22:57.140 --> 22:57.990
We're doomed.

22:58.390 --> 23:00.190
That's absolutely impossible.

23:01.150 --> 23:03.120
How can it be 1 tael?

23:03.150 --> 23:04.670
Even in Nanjing it's 1.2 taels!

23:04.670 --> 23:06.840
Goods have no bargaining power
at the destination, Master.

23:06.840 --> 23:07.630
I'd say by this afternoon

23:07.630 --> 23:09.030
it'll be 0.8 or 0.9 taels per dan.

23:09.030 --> 23:10.510
Then what do we do?

23:10.510 --> 23:12.080
Do you really have to gamble with them?

23:12.080 --> 23:12.610
Even if we

23:12.660 --> 23:15.080
ship the rice back now,
we'll still lose money.

23:15.080 --> 23:16.320
Three taels per dan—

23:16.340 --> 23:18.800
I bought 3.8 million dan!

23:19.860 --> 23:22.530
It's all going to rot in the warehouse!

23:26.680 --> 23:27.680
Gu!

23:30.470 --> 23:31.510
Gu!

23:32.430 --> 23:33.430
Gu!

23:35.880 --> 23:36.560
Li?

23:38.890 --> 23:39.720
I'm here.

23:39.620 --> 23:40.810
[Tranquility of Autumn]

23:40.160 --> 23:40.620
Come on.

23:43.590 --> 23:45.030
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

23:43.890 --> 23:44.430
My goodness.

23:44.430 --> 23:45.690
How much did you drink?

23:46.320 --> 23:46.920
I...

23:47.060 --> 23:48.330
Come, have a seat.

23:48.510 --> 23:52.350
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

23:49.510 --> 23:50.190
One jin?

23:51.560 --> 23:52.190
Ten jin?

23:54.880 --> 23:56.880
I've been drinking nonstop.

23:58.360 --> 23:58.890
Pingwen,

23:59.120 --> 23:59.920
make some tea.

24:01.950 --> 24:03.570
Why did you let yourself drink that much?

24:03.570 --> 24:08.780
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

24:04.990 --> 24:06.270
These past 10 days

24:07.640 --> 24:08.750
have been crazy,

24:09.600 --> 24:12.160
drinking 4 or 5 times a day,

24:13.160 --> 24:14.510
and with every rice merchant

24:13.730 --> 24:16.500
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

24:14.510 --> 24:16.600
I had to drink twice

24:17.510 --> 24:18.640
from bowls this big.

24:18.710 --> 24:19.800
It was exhausting.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.160
Come on, have some tea.

24:21.970 --> 24:26.680
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

24:23.480 --> 24:24.120
You've really done

24:24.120 --> 24:25.250
an outstanding job.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.320
Here.

24:26.790 --> 24:30.940
[Tranquility of Autumn]

24:30.430 --> 24:32.760
Your contribution this time is enormous.

24:37.400 --> 24:38.800
How enormous could it be?

24:38.990 --> 24:40.220
It's enormous enough.

24:40.220 --> 24:46.020
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

24:40.430 --> 24:41.600
Early this morning

24:41.840 --> 24:43.700
I went to Xiaguan Dock in Nanjing.

24:43.910 --> 24:45.940
Over 300 grain ships were there.

24:46.150 --> 24:47.800
They'd only just been released.

24:47.800 --> 24:48.800
Over 300?

24:49.950 --> 24:53.260
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

24:50.920 --> 24:52.600
Hurry and tell me

24:53.240 --> 24:54.790
how things are on your end

24:54.920 --> 24:56.220
so I can enjoy it.

24:56.610 --> 24:57.670
Wait a moment.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.710
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

25:16.740 --> 25:17.420
Take a look.

25:16.830 --> 25:17.590
[One Thousand Taels]

25:17.650 --> 25:20.100
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

25:18.730 --> 25:19.980
This is your capital.

25:20.470 --> 25:21.600
Altogether,

25:22.160 --> 25:23.190
we sold that old guy

25:23.190 --> 25:24.450
3.8 million dan of rice

25:26.320 --> 25:27.340
and took in

25:27.400 --> 25:29.560
11.4 million taels.

25:30.230 --> 25:31.660
Over 10 million taels?

25:31.880 --> 25:32.540
Wonderful!

25:32.670 --> 25:34.190
I just feel

25:34.660 --> 25:36.200
especially attached to the money

25:36.200 --> 25:37.420
I earn myself.

25:40.120 --> 25:40.800
Li.

25:41.220 --> 25:43.740
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

25:41.320 --> 25:42.320
Do you remember

25:42.320 --> 25:43.720
what we agreed on before?

25:45.950 --> 25:47.320
Of course I do.

25:47.490 --> 25:51.910
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

25:51.320 --> 25:52.080
These,

25:54.880 --> 25:55.760
these,

25:56.030 --> 25:56.640
these,

25:56.890 --> 25:58.090
and these—

25:58.120 --> 25:59.600
all this money...

26:00.530 --> 26:02.930
will be used to fix
the coastal embankment.

26:03.600 --> 26:04.120
That's not what I meant.

26:04.120 --> 26:04.950
This time,

26:05.270 --> 26:06.430
our main goal

26:06.450 --> 26:08.450
was to teach that old fellow a lesson

26:08.800 --> 26:09.930
and get our revenge.

26:10.070 --> 26:10.630
Li.

26:11.120 --> 26:11.950
Now the two of us are each in charge

26:11.950 --> 26:13.510
of fixing a coastal embankment,
one in the east and one in the west.

26:13.510 --> 26:14.920
If all the money stays with me,

26:14.920 --> 26:16.980
it won't be convenient for you to use.

26:17.470 --> 26:18.750
This is what you deserve.

26:18.750 --> 26:19.320
Take it.

26:20.010 --> 26:21.470
Pack it up and take it home.

26:35.560 --> 26:37.360
Thank you, Gu.

26:37.830 --> 26:39.430
What are you thanking me for?

26:40.710 --> 26:42.440
This is the first time in my life

26:43.980 --> 26:45.740
I've done business

26:45.840 --> 26:46.960
not for profit.

26:49.120 --> 26:49.920
It feels good!

26:51.880 --> 26:52.430
So good!

26:53.880 --> 26:54.470
Master!

26:55.120 --> 26:55.640
Master!

26:58.510 --> 26:59.190
Master.

27:00.080 --> 27:01.320
Don't be too sad.

27:01.990 --> 27:04.990
As long as the foundation remains,
there's still hope.

27:04.990 --> 27:07.030
It's already 1 tael per dan.

27:16.710 --> 27:17.320
Get out.

27:33.560 --> 27:35.150
Didn't I tell you to get out?

27:38.580 --> 27:40.710
When that little bastard shows up,

27:42.400 --> 27:43.710
I'll kill him.

27:45.710 --> 27:46.380
But...

27:46.610 --> 27:48.460
But that little bastard

27:48.840 --> 27:50.800
is already here.

27:58.040 --> 28:00.770
You're at least a young man
from a good family.

28:02.230 --> 28:04.160
Coming here now to laugh at me

28:04.180 --> 28:05.640
is beneath your dignity.

28:07.270 --> 28:08.270
How could I?

28:09.400 --> 28:10.470
I came today

28:11.270 --> 28:13.270
firstly to collect the pearl,

28:14.230 --> 28:14.960
and secondly

28:15.470 --> 28:16.470
to get

28:16.500 --> 28:18.630
the reward from you.

28:25.400 --> 28:27.430
You're quite something.

28:32.270 --> 28:32.880
Let's go.

28:33.360 --> 28:34.030
I'll...

28:34.750 --> 28:35.710
get you the pearl

28:36.510 --> 28:37.600
and the banknotes.

28:38.860 --> 28:39.160
Alright.

28:39.160 --> 28:41.030
Now we have a grudge between us.

28:41.840 --> 28:42.880
0.9 taels! 0.9 taels!

28:42.880 --> 28:43.800
It's 0.9 taels now!

28:43.800 --> 28:44.600
Big discount!

28:44.950 --> 28:46.120
Over here, 0.9 taels!

28:46.120 --> 28:47.120
There's enough for everyone!

28:47.120 --> 28:48.380
Come, come! 0.8 taels!

28:48.600 --> 28:49.920
0.8 taels over here!

28:51.800 --> 28:52.880
0.8 teals!

28:52.950 --> 28:54.010
0.6 teals!

28:54.190 --> 28:55.350
0.6 teals!

28:55.430 --> 28:56.360
0.6 teals! Come!

28:56.400 --> 28:57.030
0.6 teals!

28:58.400 --> 28:58.990
It's 0.6 teals now!

28:58.990 --> 29:00.230
0.6 teals over here!

29:07.430 --> 29:08.490
What are you doing?

29:09.430 --> 29:11.120
If those rice merchants see me,

29:11.120 --> 29:11.690
they'll definitely

29:11.690 --> 29:12.860
eat me alive.

29:13.400 --> 29:14.640
Just tell them you're an official

29:14.640 --> 29:16.670
sent by the imperial court
to oversee the big project.

29:16.670 --> 29:17.950
They'd be scrambling

29:17.950 --> 29:18.670
to curry favor with you.

29:18.670 --> 29:19.670
What are you afraid of?

29:19.670 --> 29:20.530
Doing business

29:20.530 --> 29:22.190
is just like putting on a show.

29:22.230 --> 29:23.690
The ones acting are crazy,

29:23.710 --> 29:25.510
and the ones watching are fools.

29:25.640 --> 29:27.600
Everyone has their role.

29:33.520 --> 29:39.750
[One Hundred Taels]

29:42.800 --> 29:43.470
Sir.

29:47.400 --> 29:48.270
Sir.

29:50.270 --> 29:51.320
What?

29:51.990 --> 29:53.710
You're a master of Neo-Confucianism.

29:53.710 --> 29:54.360
Can't you control yourself a little

29:54.360 --> 29:55.420
when you see money?

29:58.950 --> 30:01.560
Have you ever seen a sage who was poor?

30:01.800 --> 30:02.470
Nonsense.

30:04.910 --> 30:06.380
If you were poor,

30:06.840 --> 30:08.320
who would respect you?

30:11.750 --> 30:12.590
Thank you

30:12.880 --> 30:14.270
for the money.

30:14.840 --> 30:16.150
I was just eliminating threats
for the people.

30:16.150 --> 30:17.680
There's no need to thank me.

30:21.120 --> 30:21.670
Here.

30:22.430 --> 30:24.560
I have a little something for you.

30:26.360 --> 30:27.090
What is this?

30:27.400 --> 30:28.060
A painting?

30:29.510 --> 30:30.440
Mr. Gu,

30:30.750 --> 30:32.280
I consider you one of my own.

30:32.640 --> 30:34.240
How can you not show respect?

30:36.600 --> 30:37.640
Sir,

30:38.920 --> 30:41.080
you're a senior
in the imperial examinations,

30:41.080 --> 30:42.340
a first-rank viceroy,

30:42.880 --> 30:44.280
practically half a sage.

30:44.560 --> 30:45.160
And I'm

30:45.470 --> 30:47.400
just a small merchant.

30:47.840 --> 30:50.040
How would I dare call myself your equal?

30:56.230 --> 30:57.780
Don't put on

30:57.840 --> 30:59.970
that merchant's facade in front of me.

31:00.430 --> 31:01.430
When I first saw you,

31:01.430 --> 31:02.590
I told Jiu,

31:02.670 --> 31:04.230
"Is this a merchant?"

31:04.470 --> 31:06.400
"He's a born scholar."

31:06.710 --> 31:08.700
Jiu told me about you

31:08.800 --> 31:10.910
and wanted to transfer you
under my command.

31:10.910 --> 31:12.920
At first I had my doubts.

31:13.190 --> 31:14.080
You,

31:14.470 --> 31:16.270
your intelligence is too obvious.

31:16.270 --> 31:18.000
Luckily, you have a kind heart.

31:18.230 --> 31:19.430
Otherwise, who knows

31:19.600 --> 31:22.000
how many times
you would have died already.

31:26.030 --> 31:26.710
This is a letter

31:26.710 --> 31:28.190
I specifically submitted

31:28.230 --> 31:29.190
in my name,

31:29.230 --> 31:30.800
recommending you.

31:32.390 --> 31:35.470
I noticed that this man handles matters
with both tact and firmness.

31:35.470 --> 31:38.030
He's unassuming in appearance
but with the heart of a hero.

31:38.030 --> 31:38.990
He claims

31:39.120 --> 31:40.990
to have suffered from madness
in childhood,

31:40.990 --> 31:43.430
which flared up later
during the imperial examination.

31:43.430 --> 31:45.020
For causing a disturbance
in the examination hall,

31:45.020 --> 31:46.470
he was sentenced to exile at Ningguta.

31:46.470 --> 31:48.230
I am willing to vouch for him.

31:48.320 --> 31:51.780
He can be officially conferred
the title of Associate Jinshi.

31:51.880 --> 31:54.320
To preserve
such a pillar for the imperial court

31:54.320 --> 31:56.560
and such a talent for the southeast

31:56.580 --> 31:57.940
is my great pleasure.

32:02.270 --> 32:03.930
I dare not accept such praise.

32:06.470 --> 32:08.600
"Handles matters
with both tact and firmness."

32:08.600 --> 32:11.710
"He's unassuming in appearance
but with the heart of a hero."

32:11.710 --> 32:13.770
In all my years of evaluating people,

32:14.230 --> 32:15.930
only you

32:16.550 --> 32:18.070
deserve these words.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.720
This is a letter

32:22.880 --> 32:24.860
from the Ministry of Rites.

32:22.990 --> 32:24.660
[Gu Pingyuan, from Jianshan County
in Huizhou Prefecture]

32:24.920 --> 32:25.720
Go back

32:25.750 --> 32:27.750
and prepare a record
of your ancestors for 3 generations.

32:27.750 --> 32:30.950
I will submit the memorial first thing
tomorrow morning.

32:31.470 --> 32:32.670
Does this small token of gratitude

32:32.670 --> 32:34.120
meet with your approval?

32:42.060 --> 32:42.970
Mr. Gu.

32:51.920 --> 32:52.690
Mr. Gu!

32:53.500 --> 32:54.970
Are you stunned?

33:02.150 --> 33:03.880
To wash away a lifetime of shame

33:04.600 --> 33:05.800
is like being reborn.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.010
Indeed.

33:09.510 --> 33:12.410
How could a hero
remain in obscurity for long?

33:12.600 --> 33:15.260
I am satisfied
with having handled this matter.

33:15.430 --> 33:16.320
Today,

33:16.340 --> 33:17.740
don't go back to Nantong.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.450
Spend time with your family,

33:19.450 --> 33:21.190
get the 3 generations' record ready,

33:21.190 --> 33:23.250
and bring them first thing tomorrow.

33:23.600 --> 33:24.320
Yes.

33:25.430 --> 33:25.950
Sir,

33:25.970 --> 33:27.840
there's another troublesome matter.

33:27.840 --> 33:28.860
When I was a kid,
my father went to the capital

33:28.860 --> 33:30.230
to take the imperial examination

33:30.230 --> 33:31.710
and has been missing ever since.

33:31.710 --> 33:33.910
I don't know whether he is alive or dead.

33:34.320 --> 33:35.160
I've actually

33:35.160 --> 33:37.190
heard Sixth Prince mention this.

33:38.360 --> 33:39.580
The year your father went
to take the imperial examination,

33:39.580 --> 33:41.320
there was a major epidemic in the capital,

33:41.320 --> 33:42.520
and many people died.

33:42.940 --> 33:44.950
The Nine Gates Infantry Commander
at the time

33:44.950 --> 33:47.340
had all the bodies burned,

33:47.560 --> 33:49.090
so there's no way to verify.

33:49.190 --> 33:50.450
Just write it that way.

33:53.190 --> 33:53.920
Sir.

33:57.120 --> 33:58.920
I want to sincerely kowtow to you

33:59.390 --> 34:01.010
on my father's behalf.

34:03.500 --> 34:04.600
So all this time

34:04.630 --> 34:06.190
you weren't really sincere
in your kowtows,

34:06.190 --> 34:06.840
were you?

34:08.630 --> 34:09.900
Most of the time, no.

34:13.210 --> 34:14.000
This time,

34:14.550 --> 34:16.719
being able to bring honor to 3 generations

34:16.719 --> 34:18.590
and earn him an official rank,

34:19.679 --> 34:21.800
I'm even happier
than if I received it myself.

34:21.800 --> 34:22.630
Of course.

34:23.320 --> 34:24.320
With an official rank,

34:24.320 --> 34:25.850
even in the afterlife,

34:25.880 --> 34:27.260
it's still an honor.

34:27.469 --> 34:28.280
Also,

34:28.469 --> 34:29.840
it wasn't easy for your mother

34:29.840 --> 34:31.929
to raise you from childhood.

34:32.150 --> 34:33.400
Once you achieve merit,

34:33.400 --> 34:34.820
I'll submit a memorial for you

34:34.820 --> 34:37.820
so the imperial court
can grant her an honorary title.

34:38.760 --> 34:40.620
I thank you on behalf of my mother.

34:40.800 --> 34:41.679
I'll go back now

34:41.719 --> 34:42.429
and tell her about this.

34:42.429 --> 34:43.469
Okay.

34:48.840 --> 34:49.760
By the way, Sir,

34:50.510 --> 34:51.770
there's one more thing

34:52.110 --> 34:53.239
I hope you'll allow.

34:53.949 --> 34:55.880
Li Qin and I are brothers after all.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.430
Li Wantang is Li Wantang,

34:57.550 --> 34:58.550
and he is himself.

34:59.680 --> 35:02.320
He made great contributions
to the coastal embankment project

35:02.320 --> 35:04.030
and the reduction
of the rice price this time.

35:04.030 --> 35:04.720
He wants to earn the operating rights

35:04.720 --> 35:06.800
of the Lianghuai region's salt industry

35:06.800 --> 35:07.820
only because he made a bet

35:07.820 --> 35:08.750
with his family,

35:09.150 --> 35:11.480
wanting to become independent from them.

35:11.760 --> 35:13.150
I hope you can see this clearly.

35:13.150 --> 35:13.880
How about you

35:14.030 --> 35:15.760
let him handle the salt fields?

35:20.150 --> 35:21.990
I have a reason

35:22.240 --> 35:24.100
for not giving him the salt lands.

35:24.430 --> 35:27.030
Last time you went
to negotiate with the Westerners,

35:27.030 --> 35:29.040
they refused to budge even a little.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.530
They want to get into tea

35:30.550 --> 35:31.610
and silk business—

35:31.760 --> 35:32.950
anything that makes money,

35:32.950 --> 35:34.480
they want their hands on it.

35:34.840 --> 35:35.600
If we really

35:35.630 --> 35:37.690
give all the salt fields to Li Wantang

35:37.880 --> 35:39.150
and he sells them to the Westerner,

35:39.150 --> 35:40.150
what should we do?

35:40.360 --> 35:41.360
Can I stop him?

35:42.030 --> 35:44.490
What if the Westerners
jack up the salt price

35:44.510 --> 35:46.590
and the people
of the Seven Provinces of Jiangnan

35:46.590 --> 35:47.510
revolt?

35:48.630 --> 35:50.760
Can you take responsibility for that?

35:52.920 --> 35:54.250
I didn't consider that.

35:54.630 --> 35:55.950
I was short-sighted.

35:57.760 --> 35:59.290
I'll request credit for him

35:59.510 --> 36:01.570
for the coastal embankment project.

36:01.990 --> 36:03.920
He can have some of the salt fields,

36:03.920 --> 36:06.430
but the imperial court must keep some too.

36:06.990 --> 36:07.870
And frankly,

36:08.150 --> 36:09.400
those salt fields he has

36:09.400 --> 36:10.110
were taken

36:10.150 --> 36:11.480
by exploiting the chaos

36:11.590 --> 36:13.200
during the war in the south.

36:13.950 --> 36:15.880
One shouldn't be too greedy.

36:18.400 --> 36:19.320
Gu Pingyuan,

36:20.510 --> 36:21.400
you know,

36:21.950 --> 36:23.400
your intelligence is too obvious.

36:23.400 --> 36:25.430
Trouble will find you in the future.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.670
You spared him today,

36:29.200 --> 36:30.550
but in the future, he might not

36:30.550 --> 36:32.150
show you the same mercy.

36:34.280 --> 36:35.150
You may go.

36:36.030 --> 36:36.680
Yes.

36:42.930 --> 36:47.840
[Tranquility of Autumn]

36:43.430 --> 36:44.150
Mother.

36:46.430 --> 36:47.030
Mother.

36:47.960 --> 36:50.850
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

36:49.150 --> 36:49.760
Father.

36:50.070 --> 36:50.920
Uncle Liao.

36:51.030 --> 36:51.630
Come here.

36:51.920 --> 36:52.530
Hurry.

36:53.240 --> 36:54.100
What happened?

37:00.320 --> 37:01.320
My eyes

37:01.360 --> 37:02.890
are failing me completely.

37:03.200 --> 37:04.950
Mr. Chang, please read it to me.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.680
Alright.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.370
Gu Pingyuan,

37:08.470 --> 37:11.000
from Shanjian Village, Huizhou Prefecture.

37:11.240 --> 37:12.760
In the third year of Xianfeng,

37:12.760 --> 37:15.240
he placed third in the county-level exam

37:15.320 --> 37:17.650
in Shanjian County, Huizhou Prefecture.

37:19.800 --> 37:21.360
In the fifth year of Xianfeng,

37:21.360 --> 37:24.020
he ranked first
in the Huizhou provincial exam.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.370
For his merit, he was granted

37:25.370 --> 37:27.070
the title of Associate Jinshi.

37:27.070 --> 37:30.270
Recommender: Ling Gui, Minister of Rites.

37:30.430 --> 37:31.400
Guarantor:

37:31.880 --> 37:34.190
Rui Lin, Viceroy of Liangjiang.

37:34.230 --> 37:35.160
Is this for real?

37:36.420 --> 37:37.880
Heaven has smiled upon us?

37:38.660 --> 37:40.400
Heaven has smiled upon us!

37:41.110 --> 37:41.920
Old Madam Gu,

37:42.280 --> 37:44.030
Pingyuan has finally achieved success.

37:44.030 --> 37:45.760
He has a prestigious title now.

37:45.920 --> 37:47.470
Congratulations!

37:48.990 --> 37:49.840
Mother,

37:50.510 --> 37:52.920
the Viceroy of Liangjiang
recommended Pingyuan,

37:52.920 --> 37:53.680
granting him

37:53.680 --> 37:55.410
the title of Associate Jinshi.

37:57.880 --> 37:59.550
My son has left behind his lowly status?

37:59.550 --> 38:01.280
Indeed.

38:03.150 --> 38:05.080
Prostitutes, actors, musicians,

38:05.150 --> 38:07.480
and major criminals of the imperial court

38:07.840 --> 38:10.800
are barred from taking the
imperial examinations for 3 generations.

38:10.800 --> 38:11.910
Now it's perfect.

38:11.950 --> 38:13.020
Your grandson

38:13.320 --> 38:14.550
and his descendants

38:15.200 --> 38:16.200
will have

38:16.220 --> 38:17.660
a bright future.

38:19.810 --> 38:21.030
Where's our hero?

38:21.250 --> 38:22.620
[Gentle Breeze & Bright Moon]

38:21.920 --> 38:23.050
Don't call him that.

38:23.070 --> 38:25.130
Pingyuan is now an Associate Jinshi.

38:25.130 --> 38:26.150
Jinshis

38:26.200 --> 38:28.330
are like stars descended from heaven.

38:28.550 --> 38:29.550
He doesn't have time

38:29.550 --> 38:31.680
to chat with us about trivial matters.

38:32.760 --> 38:33.980
Indeed, Father.

38:34.110 --> 38:35.010
And stop calling him

38:35.010 --> 38:36.160
Mr. Chang anymore.

38:36.400 --> 38:37.330
He's now

38:37.360 --> 38:38.950
the father-in-law of an Associate Jinshi.

38:38.950 --> 38:40.960
We should call him Master Chang.

38:42.620 --> 38:43.840
Master Chang.

38:45.430 --> 38:46.630
Stop putting on airs.

38:46.840 --> 38:47.830
Your son-in-law

38:47.880 --> 38:49.800
won't mind your humble origins?

38:50.550 --> 38:52.020
You should go ask around.

38:52.110 --> 38:54.550
Will the daughter
of the Viceroy of Liangjiang

38:54.550 --> 38:55.760
marry him?

38:57.110 --> 38:57.990
Indeed.

38:58.630 --> 39:00.360
Anything could happen.

39:00.990 --> 39:03.190
He doesn't have a daughter to marry him.

39:03.400 --> 39:04.360
That's so improper.

39:04.360 --> 39:06.150
Why do I remember that he has one?

39:06.150 --> 39:06.720
Mother,

39:06.990 --> 39:07.920
let's go inside.

39:09.030 --> 39:09.880
He does?

39:10.170 --> 39:11.040
Yes.

39:14.740 --> 39:18.300
[Half a City]

39:20.070 --> 39:21.800
Careful. Be more careful.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.400
It's Emperor Jiaqing's calligraphy.

39:23.400 --> 39:26.260
Damaging even a bit of lacquer
is a serious offense.

39:26.920 --> 39:28.030
Every time I see this plaque,

39:28.030 --> 39:28.830
I always think

39:29.070 --> 39:30.300
it's only natural that

39:30.300 --> 39:31.590
I've accomplished nothing in my life.

39:31.590 --> 39:32.790
Look, your ancestors

39:32.980 --> 39:37.140
[Half a City]

39:33.030 --> 39:35.030
were already so prestigious
a hundred or so years ago.

39:35.030 --> 39:36.230
Truly incomparable.

39:36.630 --> 39:38.690
This belongs to my wife's ancestors.

39:40.430 --> 39:41.430
Back then their holdings

39:41.430 --> 39:42.320
were barely half a city.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.780
But in your hands, Master—

39:43.920 --> 39:44.590
my goodness—

39:44.590 --> 39:46.430
the business is nearly half a country now.

39:46.430 --> 39:47.450
The current emperor

39:47.450 --> 39:49.110
should write you a new plaque.

39:49.630 --> 39:50.630
Write me a plaque?

39:50.990 --> 39:52.990
Such little gain for so much effort.

39:55.630 --> 39:56.470
You may go.

39:57.950 --> 39:58.840
Master, look.

39:59.240 --> 39:59.920
These are all the guests who,

39:59.920 --> 40:01.070
knowing we're reopening Li's Draft Bank

40:01.070 --> 40:02.440
in Nanjing,

40:02.470 --> 40:03.800
want to pay us a visit.

40:03.990 --> 40:05.650
Which one should we see first?

40:06.150 --> 40:07.550
Let's see them one by one.

40:07.880 --> 40:09.590
It's customary for visitors
to pay respects to residents.

40:09.590 --> 40:11.630
Let's start
with the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

40:11.630 --> 40:12.950
I've already arranged it for you.

40:12.950 --> 40:13.920
His Excellency said

40:13.920 --> 40:14.840
he'll send his sedan chair tomorrow

40:14.840 --> 40:15.990
with 6 imperial guards

40:15.990 --> 40:17.150
to invite you to his residence.

40:17.150 --> 40:18.280
Even the 6 guards

40:18.320 --> 40:19.580
wear official's hats.

40:19.590 --> 40:21.320
In the entire Liangjiang region,

40:21.320 --> 40:22.780
no one else has such honor.

40:23.840 --> 40:25.110
It's merely a formality.

40:25.110 --> 40:27.070
Do you think
I dare ride in his sedan chair?

40:27.070 --> 40:28.990
If an imperial censor sees me
and reports it to the court,

40:28.990 --> 40:30.250
it would be a disaster.

40:31.360 --> 40:32.760
That old fox.

40:32.990 --> 40:34.720
He is holding on to the salt fields

40:34.720 --> 40:36.720
and won't let me lay my hands on them.

40:38.430 --> 40:39.030
Master,

40:40.030 --> 40:41.360
didn't you give this matter

40:41.360 --> 40:43.110
to Young Master to handle?

40:44.250 --> 40:46.340
Why not have him stand up?

40:44.370 --> 40:46.280
[Everything as Wished]

40:46.840 --> 40:49.100
He's been kneeling since early morning.

40:52.610 --> 40:59.420
[Grand Vision for Long-Lasting Prosperity]

40:59.490 --> 41:02.090
[Everything as Wished]

41:01.360 --> 41:01.950
Come on.

41:02.200 --> 41:04.440
Directly appointing a jinshi
to serve as a local official?

41:04.440 --> 41:06.110
This is called the "Tiger List?"

41:06.110 --> 41:08.950
At the very least,
you would be a county magistrate.

41:08.950 --> 41:10.430
Being a county magistrate is not bad.

41:10.430 --> 41:11.510
A county magistrate

41:11.510 --> 41:13.550
is the parent official of a whole county.

41:13.550 --> 41:15.450
That's a lot of power.

41:17.630 --> 41:18.830
You lowly commoner.

41:19.030 --> 41:20.590
You're not convinced, are you?

41:20.590 --> 41:22.400
The magistrate is holding court!

41:22.400 --> 41:23.430
I'll stand aside.

41:25.380 --> 41:26.260
It's a good thing

41:26.260 --> 41:27.820
you're not the one becoming an official.

41:27.820 --> 41:28.530
If you were,

41:28.550 --> 41:31.080
the world wouldn't be big enough
for your ego.

41:31.150 --> 41:31.600
Pingyuan,

41:31.600 --> 41:33.370
I'm just happy for you.

41:34.010 --> 41:34.770
I just can't stand

41:34.770 --> 41:36.300
seeing you frown like that.

41:36.890 --> 41:37.710
I'm telling you,

41:37.710 --> 41:38.510
sometimes,

41:38.720 --> 41:40.070
people just can't
help making things hard...

41:40.070 --> 41:40.920
for themselves.

41:40.920 --> 41:42.380
Who are you talking about?

41:42.760 --> 41:43.990
Who are you talking about?

41:43.990 --> 41:45.030
Get out!

41:50.630 --> 41:51.240
Mother.

41:52.110 --> 41:52.710
Mr. Chang.

41:53.110 --> 41:53.680
Mr. Liao.

41:54.430 --> 41:55.160
Son-in-law.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.440
My Lord.

41:57.590 --> 41:59.730
Your mother deserves your bow,

41:59.760 --> 42:01.680
but the two of us don't now.

42:01.760 --> 42:02.560
That's right.

42:02.950 --> 42:03.670
Mr. Chang—

42:03.760 --> 42:04.320
No, no.

42:04.320 --> 42:05.780
Master Chang said

42:05.950 --> 42:08.030
you've finally made something of yourself.

42:08.030 --> 42:09.320
If you ask me,

42:09.550 --> 42:10.070
kid,

42:10.360 --> 42:12.280
you've built great virtue

42:12.360 --> 42:14.240
by fixing that coastal embankment.

42:14.240 --> 42:15.030
At noon,

42:15.150 --> 42:17.360
we should have a proper lunch, right?

42:18.760 --> 42:19.510
Mother,

42:20.200 --> 42:20.800
I...

42:21.320 --> 42:23.250
You're afraid you can't handle it?

42:26.360 --> 42:27.240
A little bit.

42:30.030 --> 42:30.590
Come.

42:31.150 --> 42:31.990
Come with me.

42:35.430 --> 42:36.960
Let's have lunch together.

42:42.470 --> 42:42.950
Come.

42:49.340 --> 42:50.210
It's fine.

42:54.400 --> 42:55.110
You may go.

42:58.200 --> 42:59.530
Have you figured it out?

43:01.800 --> 43:02.840
Not at all.
